 Do you read me?

243
00:24:21,410 --> 00:24:36,720
 This is the cruiser Hummingbird.

244
00:24:36,720 --> 00:25:02,230
 He's still there.

245
00:25:02,230 --> 00:25:03,260
 He didn't get away.

246
00:25:03,260 --> 00:25:05,590
 We didn't think of him.

247
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,870
 About time somebody thought of me.

248
00:25:07,870 --> 00:25:09,850
 About Metro.

249
00:25:09,850 --> 00:25:11,260
 Where are you calling from?

250
00:25:11,260 --> 00:25:12,190
 Cassiopeia?

251
00:25:12,190 --> 00:25:14,130
 First night, I'm just above your head.

252
00:25:14,130 --> 00:25:14,930
 It's nice out here.

253
00:25:14,930 --> 00:25:16,690
 Glorious scenery.

254
00:25:16,690 --> 00:25:18,430
 There's one advantage to being a robot.

255
00:25:18,430 --> 00:25:21,410
 For instance, now I've no need to breathe.

